OL,3,GNEWSAFamily set up charity in
OL,4,Amusic-loving son's memory
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has set up a charity to help
OL,7,Faspiring musicians in memory of their
OL,8,Fmusic-loving son who died earlier this
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FDan Towriss, 24, from Rotherham, was
OL,12,Fautistic and his sudden death in July
OL,13,F"left the biggest hole in my heart",
OL,14,Fsaid his mother Jennifer.
OL,16,FHis father, Nick, said the family had
OL,17,Fset up a charitable foundation in Dan's
OL,18,Fhonour to help young people "learn
OL,19,Fmusic, experience music and find the
OL,20,Fjoy in music".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
